# Discrimination proof - the report step extracted verbatim from .github/workflows/ci.yml

Every scenario below runs `bash -e evidence/step-report-from-yaml.sh` with cwd = the repo root
and GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY set, which is how GitHub Actions runs a `run:` step. Exit codes are
read directly from the step process, never through a pipe. The extracted step is byte-identical
to the step in the committed blob (compare hashes.txt, raw-logs/attr-body.sh,
commit-clean-tree.txt).

